{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "0b8f2d4e-6a1c-47d3-9f5e-8c2a1b7d4e60"/*SendToOutput*/,
  "Description": "Sends a texture to a setup output, optionally to a specific surface on it.\n\nThis is a sink: it declares that its incoming texture belongs on the referenced output (and surface) of the project's active output setup, and needs no output connection. The output manager collects these, corner-pin warps each surface's slice, and composites and presents the result. With only an output set, every surface on that output slices the same image.\n\nAKA: corner pin, perspective, map, warp, projector output, send, sink",
